cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, cite the repository and the NASA publications it retrieval-grounds, which remain under their own terms."
title: "AXIOM: evidence-grounded intelligence for spacecraft fire safety"
abstract: "A deterministic research workspace over NASA microgravity combustion literature. It retrieves located passages, checks claim support, compares hypothetical spacecraft fire scenarios with documented experimental conditions, and proposes explicitly unexecuted follow-up experiments."
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-13"
license: MIT
authors:
  - name: "AXIOM project contributors"
keywords:
  - microgravity combustion
  - spacecraft fire safety
  - NASA
  - evidence retrieval
  - scientific claim checking
  - experiment planning
